}{AB} & =⟨0,1⟩-⟨1,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,1⟩ \\\\ u & =\\frac{\\overset{\\to }{AB}}{‖\\overset{\\to }{AB}‖} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{1}^{2}}}⟨-1,1⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨-1,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we calculate the gradient $∇f(x,y)$ and evaluate it at the point $A(1,0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y) & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x{e}^{y}+{x}^{2}y),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x{e}^{y}+{x}^{2}y)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{y}+2xy,\\,x{e}^{y}+{x}^{2}⟩ \\\\ ∇\\,f(1,0) & =⟨{e}^{0}+2\\cdot 1\\cdot 0,\\,1\\cdot {e}^{0}+{1}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the directional derivative is:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{u}^{′}(1,0) & =∇f(1,0)\\cdot u \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,2⟩\\cdot ⟨-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324028 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 & -\\sqrt{3}\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186324028 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324028 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "062eed09-81dd-5674-a309-e790c54980b9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324421 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186324421 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324421 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "374dbd31-4def-5c1f-8b3b-f510d1346987" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324685 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186324685 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186324685 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "55bfa436-004a-568e-80e1-3838e7d226da" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325561 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186325561 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186325561 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "b96e5865-e78d-55e1-b385-bbe41fc15642" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186326109 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2